+
+### Guarded integer-comparison simplification
+
+- **Extension:** `applyCmp("==", V:Val, I:Int) => {V}:>Int ==Int I`
+  when `isInt(V)`.
+- **Class:** Derived lemma.
+- **Semantic role:** Refines the existing `MPY-INT` equality equation after
